      "point": "Both define the thorax as the body region between the neck and the abdomen.",
      "quote_britannica": "THORAX, in anatomy. See Anatomy, p. 277.",
      "quote_wikipedia": "The thorax (pl.: thoraces or thoraxes) or chest is a part of the anatomy of mammals and other tetrapod animals located between the neck and the abdomen."
