      "point": "Both identify the thorax as one of the three main body divisions in insects.",
      "quote_britannica": "THORAX, in anatomy. See Anatomy, p. 277.",
      "quote_wikipedia": "In insects, crustaceans, and the extinct trilobites, the thorax is one of the three main divisions of the body, each in turn composed of multiple segments."
